    """Extract (repo_type, repo_id) from an API URL.

    Returns canonical repo_type values: "model", "dataset", "space" (or None).

    Examples:
        >>> _parse_repo_info_from_url("https://huggingface.co/api/models/user/repo")
        ("model", "user/repo")
